  "provenance": "Imported from the original SimGame3Yield table by scripts/import-farm-yield.py. Levels, percentages and costs are the table's own values. The original reads this as farm NPC5's level (the Magic Tree) and adds buildingYieldPercent to every building. Percent is buildingYieldPercent/100, a whole number.",
